  "composition_summary": "Preserved the volatile tail unchanged (single user request, no justified repair). Drafted one class-22 pure-logic component pc-contrast-09: it reads raw records via inputs.get('records') (never direct access), validates that records is a nonempty list of 1..2 objects each with exactly code (string length 2..5) and enabled (exact bool), and returns {ok, records: original if valid else []} with no exceptions or coercion. The body assigns result on every outcome, makes zero host/IO calls, and does not assume upstream validation. This is an unapproved target-interface draft; activation requires Q1, human Q2 and runtime typed-runner support, which are not claimed here.",
